{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115112","id":3186084777,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6958up","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115112","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115112.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115112.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115112","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115112/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115112/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115112/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bbee01a8ba9783ce7ad3b563c29ea67284c2f89c","number":115112,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Multiplayer: Pause packet processing while waiting on SceneTree to change the current scene","user":{"login":"funkysandwich","id":56569029,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTY5MDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56569029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich","html_url":"https://github.com/funkysandwich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to fix #68407\r\n\r\nThis adds a method to the MultiplayerAPI to set if packet processing should be paused, and the SceneTree will use this method to pause and resume packet processing between scene changes.\r\n\r\n> The problem relies on the deferred nature of `change_scene_to_*`, and would require the multiplayer API to temporarily stop processing packets or implement some form of scene reconciliation process.\r\n\r\nThis way, the client is able to catch up before attempting to process packets for spawners or synchronizers within the target scene.\r\n\r\nDisclosure: I'm not too familiar with the lower level networking or engine code, so if there's something odd with how I've implemented this, or if I should take a different approach, please let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTesting with this MRP:\r\n[multiplayer-nodes-4.6.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24700437/multiplayer-nodes-4.6.zip)\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"2982\" height=\"2022\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/245b0f05-18e5-4856-8ddf-127c76f9a992\" />\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"2769\" height=\"1939\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72cb81f7-3e66-408c-af82-b6e15c4cd66e\" />\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4332209698,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAjhGIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:multiplayer","name":"topic:multiplayer